<p>You guard against melee damage with a sweep of your hand. So long as you can use Gestures (Requires two free or mindstar-equipped hands), you deflect up to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Strength 100,<br>Cunning 100,<br>physical power 100">9, 12, 14, 16, 17</acronym> damage (<acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">23%, 30%, 35%, 38%, 41%</acronym> of your best free hand melee damage) from up to <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Strength 10, 25, 50, 75, 100,<br>Cunning 10, 25, 50, 75, 100,<br>physical power 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">0.0, 0.6, 1.3, 1.8, 2.3</acronym> melee attack(s) each turn (based on your cunning). Deflected attacks cannot be crits.</p><p>If Gesture of Pain is active, you also have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4.5%, 5.9%, 6.9%, 7.8%, 8.5%</acronym> chance to counterattack.</p>